":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-23T14:45:00+08:00","version":"Cantonese,Ma","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1306","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-aftersun","title":"Aftersun","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-23T08:10:00Z","end":"2026-11-23T10:07:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Charlotte Wells · 102 min · English\nAt a fading vacation resort, 11-year-old Sophie treasures rare time together with her loving and idealistic father, Calum. As a world of adolescence creeps into view, beyond her eye Calum struggles under the weight of life outside of fatherhood. Twenty years later, Sophie's tender recollections of their last holiday become a powerful and heartrending portrait of their relationship, as she tries to reconcile the father she knew with the man she didn't, in Charlotte Wells' superb and searingly emotional debut film. It has since become a favourite among a new generation of cinephiles.","people":["Charlotte Wells"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":100.0,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg/960px-HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1371","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-23T16:10:00+08:00","version":"English","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1371","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[{"outlet":"Fotogramas","title":"“Una herida difícil de cerrar”: ‘Blue Heron’ recuerda a ‘Aftersun’ en su retrato íntimo de una familia marcada por la tragedia","url":"https://www.fotogramas.es/peliculas-criticas/a74156750/blue-heron-critica-pelicula-drama-opinion/","date":"2026-10-22"}],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-children-of-heaven","title":"Children of Heaven","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-23T10:05:00Z","end":"2026-11-23T11:47:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Majid Majidi · 87 min · Persian\nWhen Ali loses his sister Zahra's school shoes, this young pair dream up a plan to stay out of trouble: they'll share his shoes and keep it a secret! But if they're going to cover their tracks, the kids must carefully watch their steps. When Ali discovers a student marathon offering a new pair of shoes as the third-place prize, he seizes the opportunity. In this heartwarming tale of childhood resilience, Ali and Zahra remind us that hope and love blossom even in the face of overwhelming hardship. A box-office phenomenon in its day and a huge hit at bc, the film drew widespread attention to Iranian cinema.","people":["Majid Majidi"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":100.0,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg/960px-HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1348","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-23T18:05:00+08:00","version":"Persian","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1348","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-the-last-dance","title":"The Last Dance","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-23T11:00:00Z","end":"2026-11-23T13:21:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Anselm Chan · 126 min · Cantonese\nA decade ago, Cheung Lek was the brightest rising boxing star—known as “Golden Boy”—until a tragic incident stripped him of his freedom. Ten years later, released from prison, he comes face to face with Fong Yuen, the son he has never met. To claim the inheritance left by Fong Yuen’s mother, Cheung must learn to live with and take care of the boy. Thrust into fatherhood and confronted by past regrets, Cheung’s life is turned upside down once more. Through conflict and gradual reconciliation with his son, he begins to understand his true purpose. Confronting the ghosts of his past, Cheung decides to return to the ring—not only to reclaim his dream, but to become the role model his son deserves.","people":["Anselm Chan"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":150.0,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg/960px-HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1092","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-23T19:00:00+08:00","version":"Cantonese","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1092","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-i-heard-that-they-are-not-going-to-see-each-other-anymore","title":"I Heard That They Are Not Going To See Each Other Anymore","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-23T13:35:00Z","end":"2026-12-01T15:21:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Wong Ka Ki · 86 min · English,Cant\nPresent-day Taipei. Tao, consumed by an inexplicable affection for the indifferent Shin, seeks to preserve their bond through pain. Meanwhile, Melih, a former Istanbul resident running a noodle shop, receives an unexpected flower from the perpetually drunk Ping. As he fixates on the flower, he becomes entangled in Tao's story, reflecting on his own struggles with human connection. Through these intertwined narratives, the film examines the fragility of memory and the ways we attempt to hold onto, or let go of the past.\n\nCPH: DOX","people":["Wong Ka Ki"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":80.0,"imageURL":"https://media.grabticks.com/programbF_9c760481-aeaa-47f0-9f82-0e188a9bf028.jpg","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1613","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-23T21:35:00+08:00","version":"English,Cant","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1613","note":null,"soldOut":false},{"start":"2026-11-25T18:10:00+08:00","version":"English,Cant","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1613","note":null,"soldOut":false},{"start":"2026-12-01T21:40:00+08:00","version":"English,Cant","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1613","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-you-are-the-film","title":"You Are the Film","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-23T14:00:00Z","end":"2026-11-23T15:23:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Makoto Ueda · 68 min · Japanese\nMadoka is a playwright in Shimokitazawa, Tokyo and Kazuma is a band member in the neighbouring town of Sangenjaya. One day, in their own separate lives, they decide to go and see a movie at Tollywood, an independent cinema in Shimokitazawa. In the movie they each see, they see the other person on the screen. In other words, to Madoka, Kazuma is the \"film\" she is watching, and to Kazuma, Madoka is the \"film\" he is watching. In this impossible structure, incidents occur within each other's stories, just like in a film. Kazuma and Madoka communicate through the screen and work hard to solve the problems that arise in each other's story.\n\nWhite Raven and Audience Award, Brussels International Fantastic Film Festival","people":["Makoto Ueda"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":100.0,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg/960px-HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1439","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-23T22:00:00+08:00","version":"Japanese","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1439","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-magnolia","title":"Magnolia","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-24T08:05:00Z","end":"2026-11-24T11:28:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Paul Thomas Anderson · 188 min · English\