ste-martin-mcdonagh-wild-horse-nine-est-mon-film-le-plus-politique_6808428_3246.html","date":"2026-11-08"}],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-seven-winter-in-tehran","title":"Seven Winter in Tehran","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-25T11:50:00Z","end":"2026-11-25T13:42:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Steffi Niederzoll · 97 min · Persian\nTehran, July 2007: Reyhaneh Jabbari, 19, has a business meeting with a new client. When he tries to rape her, she stabs him in self-defense. Later that day, she is arrested for murder. Her trial results in a death penalty sentence. Thanks to personal and secretly recorded videos provided by Reyhaneh's family, their testimonies and the letters written by Reyhaneh in prison, the ﬁlm retraces the fate of a woman who becomes a symbol of resistance and women's rights even beyond the borders of Iran.\n\n2023 Compass-Perspektive Award, Berlinale","people":["Steffi Niederzoll"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":100.0,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg/960px-HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1309","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-25T19:50:00+08:00","version":"Persian","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1309","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-persepolis","title":"Persepolis","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-25T13:40:00Z","end":"2026-12-17T13:41:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Marjane Satrapi, Vincent Paronnaud · 96 min · French,Germa\nBased on Marjane Satrapi's autobiographical graphic novels, Persepolis follows a rebellious and outspoken young Iranian girl, Satrapi, growing up in Tehran during and after the 1979 Islamic Revolution. Like other girls her age, Satrapi is full of imagination and longs to freely explore the world. However, with the arrival of the revolution, everything has changed. Through her eyes, we witness the fall of the Shah, the rise of the fundamentalist regime, the devastating Iran–Iraq War, and the tightening restrictions on women's freedoms. In light of the mass protests that erupted in 2025, the war with Israel and the passing of Satrapi this June, rewatching the film feels all the more poignant.","people":["Marjane Satrapi, Vincent Paronnaud"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":100.0,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg/960px-HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1361","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-25T21:40:00+08:00","version":"French,Germa","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1361","note":null,"soldOut":false},{"start":"2026-11-29T13:15:00+08:00","version":"French,Germa","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1361","note":null,"soldOut":false},{"start":"2026-12-17T19:50:00+08:00","version":"French,Germa","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1361","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-coward","title":"Coward","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-25T13:45:00Z","end":"2026-11-25T16:05:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Lukas Dhont · 125 min · French,Dutch\nOn the Western Front of World War I, young soldier Pierre is eager to prove himself, but repeatedly retrieving the bodies of fallen comrades slowly shatters his courage. When an army show is organized to boost morale, Pierre is assigned to help build the set. On stage, Francis\nperforms as a woman, his captivating charm stirring the young soldier's heart. While war rages outside, an untimely romance quietly takes root between them. Following Close, director Lukas Dhont captures forbidden love blooming against the brutality of war, led by two emerging actors who shared the Best Actor award at Cannes.\n\nBest Actor Award, Cannes Film Festival","people":["Lukas Dhont"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":95.0,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg/960px-HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1473","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-25T21:45:00+08:00","version":"French,Dutch","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1473","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":