ngURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1383","note":null,"soldOut":false},{"start":"2026-12-19T17:30:00+08:00","version":"Japanese","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1383","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-la-bola-negra-special-screening-3","title":"La Bola Negra Special Screening 3","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-27T13:35:00Z","end":"2026-11-27T16:29:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Javier Calvo, Javier Ambrossi · 159 min · Spanish,Engl\nDrawing from Spanish poet Federico García Lorca’s unfinished work of the same name, La Bola Negra weaves a century-spanning tale of three men whose lives are intimately connected through desire, pain and inheritance, across three different eras - 1932, 1937, and 2017. It became only the second Spanish film to win the Best Director Award at the Cannes Film Festival, following Pedro Almodóvar’s All About My Mother, and features special appearances by Oscar-winning actress Penélope Cruz and Honorary Oscar recipient Glenn Close. Taking home the People’s Choice Award at the Toronto International Film Festival, it broke domestic box office records upon its release.","people":["Javier Calvo, Javier Ambrossi"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":180.0,"imageURL":"https://media.grabticks.com/programiF_a7246b26-b813-44fd-a446-ef05a9fadc64.png","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1620","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-27T21:35:00+08:00","version":"Spanish,Engl","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1620","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-cube","title":"Cube","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-27T13:50:00Z","end":"2026-11-29T11:05:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Vincenzo Natali · 90 min · English\nSix different people, each from a different walk of life, awaken inside a giant cube with thousands of rooms. The identical rooms hold the threat of hideously inventive and painful death. Each gifted with a special skill, they must work together to escape an endless maze of deadly traps. Finding the real exit, however, may not offer the freedom one seeks. A micro-budget pioneer of the escape-room genre that grew into a cult sensation, the film was released at bc in 2002 to introduce local filmgoers to this overlooked gem.","people":["Vincenzo Natali"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":100.0,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg/960px-HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1356","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-27T21:50:00+08:00","version":"English","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1356","note":null,"soldOut":false},{"start":"2026-11-29T17:20:00+08:00","version":"English","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1356","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"hk-188498","title":"Art Exhibition of Chung Ling Art Association","category":"art","venueID":"osm-w159044473","start":"2026-11-27T16:00:00Z","end":"2026-11-30T15:59:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Not Applicable","people":[],"isFree":true,"priceFrom":null,"imageURL":"http