able","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/nov/19/you-can-see-everything-review-docu-hybrid-masterpiece-nathan-fielder-elizabeth-holmes","date":"2026-11-19"},{"outlet":"The New York Times","title":"Billy Evans Says He’d Do ‘You Can See Everything’ All Over Again","url":"https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/15/arts/billy-evans-you-can-see-everything.html","date":"2026-11-16"},{"outlet":"Le Monde","title":"Nathan Fielder, coréalisateur de « You Can See Everything », qui pourrait devenir le premier documentaire nommé à l’Oscar du meilleur film","url":"https://www.lemonde.fr/m-le-mag/article/2026/11/01/nathan-fielder-corealisateur-de-you-can-see-everything-qui-pourrait-devenir-le-premier-documentaire-nomme-a-l-oscar-du-meilleur-film_6803900_4500055.html","date":"2026-11-01"},{"outlet":"Cinemanía","title":"'You Can See Everything': dónde ver en streaming las series del creador que está arrasando este otoño con su nuevo documental","url":"https://www.20minutos.es/cinemania/series/you-can-see-everything-donde-ver-streaming-las-series-creador-que-esta-arrasando-este-otono-con-su-nuevo-documental_7054005_0.html","date":"2026-10-29"}],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-three-monkeys","title":"Three Monkeys","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-28T06:45:00Z","end":"2026-12-19T13:44:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Nuri Bilge Ceylan · 109 min · Turkish\nSee no evil, hear no evil, speak no evil – unfortunately that does not stop evil from existing. Eyup, the patriarch of a poor Turkish family, works for a wealthy politician. One day, his boss kills a man in a car accident and pays him to be the scapegoat. While Eyup is in prison, his son gets into trouble and his wife becomes the politician's mistress. How does Eyup family fall apart, when the crime is not even committed by him? That same year, bc presented a retrospective of Nuri Bilge Ceylan at HKAFF. From then on, all of his films have been screened at bc.","people":["Nuri Bilge Ceylan"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":100.0,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg/960px-HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1364","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-28T14:45:00+08:00","version":"Turkish","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1364","note":null,"soldOut":false},{"start":"2026-12-09T19:40:00+08:00","version":"Turkish","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1364","note":null,"soldOut":false},{"start":"2026-12-11T21:40:00+08:00","version":"Turkish","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1364","note":null,"soldOut":false},{"start":"2026-12-19T19:40:00+08:00","version":"Turkish","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1364","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-light-pillar","title":"Light Pillar","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-28T07:15:00Z","end":"2026-12-06T06:00:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Xu Zao · 90 min · Mandarin\nIn the near future, movies have long since become outdated. Lao Zha is a janitor at a film studio for 20 years, living only with an abandoned cat \"actor\". When the studio is closing down, the boss can no longer afford his salary and gives him a VR headset instead. Lao Zha, now jobless, unexpectedly enters a whole new world of virtual reali