singly seriously. As he begins searching for glitches in reality, his ordinary day slowly starts to unravel.\n\n1-hour Masterclass after the screening by the \"Directors' Fortnight's Artistic Director Julien Rejl on 29 NOVEMBER at Broadway Cinematheque.","people":["Quentin Dupieux"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":95.0,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg/960px-HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1513","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-11-29T14:50:00+08:00","version":"French","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1513","note":null,"soldOut":false},{"start":"2026-12-02T20:00:00+08:00","version":"French","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1513","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-blue-film-indpanda","title":"Blue Film (InDPanda)","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-11-29T09:30:00Z","end":"2026-12-12T11:10:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Elliot Tuttle · 85 min · English\nWhen fetish camboy Aaron Eagle (Kieron Moore) visits a client in exchange for $50,000, he discovers a masked man (Reed Birney) with a camera and a series of increasingly probing questions. But when the man reveals a disturbing connection to Aaron’s past, the two drop their personas and gradually reveal their true desires in a seductive thriller being called \"one of the m