jpg","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1433","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-12-06T19:20:00+08:00","version":"Korean","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1433","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-hidden-heroes","title":"Hidden Heroes","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-12-07T11:00:00Z","end":"2026-12-07T13:09:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Joe Ma Wai-Ho, Soi Cheang · 114 min · Cantonese\nOfficer Yohji Ho meets a female android who comes from the future, in a drug raid. The android's mission is to ensure the death of Yohji, the elder brother of the future \"Father of electronic Chips\", so as to help the future scientist to become what he will be. At the meantime, Yohji is suspected as the murderer of a police officer. Scared and confused, Yohji flees and goes to Mei Ling, who looks identical to the android, for a fraud passport. Knowing Mei Ling is his brother's future wife, Yohji decides to kill her to save his own life. Being pursued by the police and the android, Yohji runs away with Mei Ling and starts their adventure.","people":["Joe Ma Wai-Ho, Soi Cheang"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":150.0,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg/960px-HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/999","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-12-07T19:00:00+08:00","version":"Cantonese","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/999","note":null,"soldOut":false}],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true,"spotNote":null,"artistPick":false,"goodPick":0},{"id":"cin-bcinematheque-fatherland","title":"Fatherland","category":"cinema","venueID":"osm-w160323956","start":"2026-12-07T11:50:00Z","end":"2026-12-12T09:02:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"Paweł Pawlikowski · 82 min · German,Engli\nIn the summer of 1949, at the height of the Cold War, Thomas Mann and his daughter Erika embark on a challenging and emotional road trip in a black Buick, which takes them across a Germany in ruins. Returning home after sixteen years of exile in the US, Mann has to face not only a divided fatherland, but also a deep fracture within his own family. With Fatherland, Pawlikowski explores the themes of identity, family, love and guilt amid the turmoil and confusion of post-war Europe in his elliptical, distilled style.\n\nBest Director Award, Cannes Film Festival","people":["Paweł Pawlikowski"],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":100.0,"imageURL":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg/960px-HK_%E6%B2%B9%E9%BA%BB%E5%9C%B0_Yamatei_near_%E9%A7%BF%E7%99%BC%E8%8A%B1%E5%9C%92_Prosperous_Garden_%E7%99%BE%E8%80%81%E5%8C%AF%E9%9B%BB%E5%BD%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83_Broadway_Cinematheque_entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","sourceURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1334","sourceName":"Broadway Cinematheque","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[{"start":"2026-12-07T19:50:00+08:00","version":"German,Engli","bookingURL":"https://www.cinema.com.hk/en/movie/1334","note":null,"soldOut":false},{"start":"2026-12-12T15:25:00+08:00","v